oth}⁡(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3) & =\\frac{1+{e}^{-2(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)}}{1-{e}^{-2(-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1+{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}}{1-{e}^{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1+{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡{3}^{2}}}{1-{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡{3}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1+{3}^{2}}{1-{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1+9}{1-9} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{(-8)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166810 1038 17592186514377 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166810 1038 17592186514404 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166810 1038 17592186514448 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166810 1038 17592186514451 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166810 1038 17592186514458 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166811 1038 17592186514358 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166811 1038 17592186514365 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166811 1038 17592186514374 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166811 1038 17592186514482 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166811 1038 17592186514485 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166812 1038 17592186514387 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166812 1038 17592186514437 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166812 1038 17592186514449 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166812 1038 17592186514480 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166924 1038 17592186514444 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186166958 1038 17592186514381 13194139535541 17592186045417 true] [17592186167248 1068 17592186164595 13194139535541 17592186045417 false] [17592186167248 1068 17592186164598 13194139535541 17592186045417 false] [17592186167248 1068 17592186164605 13194139535541 17592186045417 false] [17592186167248 1071 "![](images/71/718df02f2d0c2f01cc4a02a40da120178afe0f436bbf38cd5a8d249d87b5d1c9.png)\n\nConsider the phase portrait above showing a solution of a Lotka-Volterra pre